    LLM: 'Place ante bet (optional AA bonus side bet). Dealer gives 2 hole cards to each player and themselves. 3-card flop dealt face up. Decision: Fold (lose ante) OR Place play bet (2x ante amount). Turn and river dealt. Dealer reveals hole cards. Best 5-card hand from 7 cards wins. Dealer qualifies with pair of 4s or better.',
